### Icon Usage Rules

#### When to Check These Rules
- When adding or modifying icons
- When creating new components with icons
- When implementing custom icons

#### Rules
- Use the `humicon` helper for all icons
- Use heroicons as the base icon set
- Custom icons go in app/assets/images/icons
- Icon helper parameters:
  - name (required): The icon identifier
  - class: Tailwind classes for sizing/styling
  - size: Optional size override
  - aria: Accessibility attributes

#### Examples
✅ Correct:
```haml
= humicon 'trash', class: 'h-4 w-4', aria: { label: 'Delete' }
= humicon 'check', class: 'h-5 w-5 text-green-500'
```

❌ Incorrect:
- Using raw SVGs
- Not providing aria labels
- Inconsistent sizing
- Not using the humicon helper

#### Common Mistakes to Avoid
- Using raw SVGs instead of humicon helper
- Missing accessibility attributes
- Inconsistent icon sizing
- Not following the icon naming convention

#### Validation Checklist
- [ ] Using humicon helper
- [ ] Proper aria labels provided
- [ ] Consistent sizing with Tailwind classes
- [ ] Custom icons in correct directory
- [ ] Following icon naming conventions
